Z||000000||Alex2004||12-23-2001||11:55 PM||||i installed the lighted window switch conversion in my fiero tonight, the switches were out of an 87-89 or something grand prix. anyways, i tested both of the led's before i installed them and they both worked.  now since they are installed only the drivers side works.  i spliced them into the auto shifter light.  i've move the hot wire from the led to the ignition power on the switch and it still didn't come on, and then i did the ground and the hot and still nothing.  anyone know what's wrong here? i thought led's were supposed to never burn out.  anyways, they still look good even though it doesn't work, i'll just have to get another switch if this one cannot be fixed but both work great.  thanks for any help!<P>Alex...||||reg||1
